OL,3,ABoy band star swaps stage for
OL,4,Aracecourse
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former X Factor contestant and boy
OL,7,Fband member says his return to horse
OL,8,Fracing feels like a full-circle moment
OL,9,Fas he swaps the stage for the
OL,10,Fracecourse.
OL,12,FBefore finding fame with pop group
OL,13,FUnion J, JJ Hamblett, who grew up in
OL,14,FNewmarket in Suffolk, spent his youth
OL,15,Fhorse racing and gained his jockey
OL,16,Flicence at 16.
OL,18,FHis first competitive appearance came
OL,19,Fat Doncaster Racecourse in 2005 and on
OL,20,F11 September, he will return there to
OL,21,Ftake part in The Leger Legends race.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
